    "name": "Pekoe",
    "steam_appid": 1626350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/a18f033e749f76b8a8423528aad604b6.avif?t=1733168744\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/1ec6c676cdfc87289d4e7f87b45232fc.poster.avif?t=1733168744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/1ec6c676cdfc87289d4e7f87b45232fc.webm?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/1ec6c676cdfc87289d4e7f87b45232fc.mp4?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As the newest resident and teahouse owner in town, you\u2019ll learn everything there is to tea. <br>Learn new rituals and tea-making styles to make an endless combination of recipes. Build relationships with the townsfolk, and visit their teahouses to purchase exclusive teaware and ingredients.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/babe075f6518e06917447e6f88fa93b9.avif?t=1733168744\" /></div><br>There are over 10 unique characters in town for you to get to know, with 7 distinct teahouses to visit, and endless tea combinations to try! Make tea in a number of different styles and teaware, and choose what to serve the townsfolk and customers (but don't forget, they all have their own likes and dislikes!).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/5a53760a9d02c3b6741493c75dcab8e5.poster.avif?t=1733168744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/5a53760a9d02c3b6741493c75dcab8e5.webm?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/5a53760a9d02c3b6741493c75dcab8e5.mp4?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/07a3e8cb64840b0ed6aefc1a456c6a47.avif?t=1733168744\" /></div><br>Starting a new life in an old teahouse can come with its own challenges, but it's nothing a bit of fresh paint, hard work, and a few cups of tea can't fix! Upgrade and customize your teahouse with your own choice of decor, and unlock new items from the townsfolk to help in your tea-making endeavors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/cf7cd1ad897d63e09e6ec75863400806.poster.avif?t=1733168744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/cf7cd1ad897d63e09e6ec75863400806.webm?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/cf7cd1ad897d63e09e6ec75863400806.mp4?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/b1b6db888ea700d37738665b6afa21dc.avif?t=1733168744\" /></div><br>Having tea together is more than just a drink, it's a chance to get to spend time together-- you'll learn what tea means to others through various rituals, ceremonies, and one-on-one conversations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/09e78cbef6ba2d8634605a981aaafd30.poster.avif?t=1733168744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/09e78cbef6ba2d8634605a981aaafd30.webm?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/09e78cbef6ba2d8634605a981aaafd30.mp4?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/a18f033e749f76b8a8423528aad604b6.avif?t=1733168744\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/1ec6c676cdfc87289d4e7f87b45232fc.poster.avif?t=1733168744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/1ec6c676cdfc87289d4e7f87b45232fc.webm?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/1ec6c676cdfc87289d4e7f87b45232fc.mp4?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As the newest resident and teahouse owner in town, you\u2019ll learn everything there is to tea. <br>Learn new rituals and tea-making styles to make an endless combination of recipes. Build relationships with the townsfolk, and visit their teahouses to purchase exclusive teaware and ingredients.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/babe075f6518e06917447e6f88fa93b9.avif?t=1733168744\" /></div><br>There are over 10 unique characters in town for you to get to know, with 7 distinct teahouses to visit, and endless tea combinations to try! Make tea in a number of different styles and teaware, and choose what to serve the townsfolk and customers (but don't forget, they all have their own likes and dislikes!).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/5a53760a9d02c3b6741493c75dcab8e5.poster.avif?t=1733168744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/5a53760a9d02c3b6741493c75dcab8e5.webm?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/5a53760a9d02c3b6741493c75dcab8e5.mp4?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/07a3e8cb64840b0ed6aefc1a456c6a47.avif?t=1733168744\" /></div><br>Starting a new life in an old teahouse can come with its own challenges, but it's nothing a bit of fresh paint, hard work, and a few cups of tea can't fix! Upgrade and customize your teahouse with your own choice of decor, and unlock new items from the townsfolk to help in your tea-making endeavors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/cf7cd1ad897d63e09e6ec75863400806.poster.avif?t=1733168744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/cf7cd1ad897d63e09e6ec75863400806.webm?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/cf7cd1ad897d63e09e6ec75863400806.mp4?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/b1b6db888ea700d37738665b6afa21dc.avif?t=1733168744\" /></div><br>Having tea together is more than just a drink, it's a chance to get to spend time together-- you'll learn what tea means to others through various rituals, ceremonies, and one-on-one conversations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/09e78cbef6ba2d8634605a981aaafd30.poster.avif?t=1733168744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/09e78cbef6ba2d8634605a981aaafd30.webm?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626350/extras/09e78cbef6ba2d8634605a981aaafd30.mp4?t=1733168744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Blend tea and friendship in the flavourful world of Pekoe, a cozy cat-filled tea-making simulator about taking the time for self-care and connecting with what makes you happy. Build relationships, upgrade your teahouse, and discover new recipes as you work towards creating a place you can call home.",
